<h1>QuTech service administration</h1><section class="panel prose"><h2>Manage a growing SaaS service</h2><p>Maintain customer contacts, plans, modules and subscriptions. Record usage, configure discounts, generate monthly invoices and review business reports.</p><h2>Accountability</h2><p>Only signed-in administrators can access the workspace. Successful business changes and sign-in activity are recorded in the audit trail.</p><h2>Coursework environment</h2><p>The starter data is fictional. All amounts are AUD; the monthly billing model excludes tax, proration and online payment processing. Invoice payment status records an administrator's confirmation.</p><p>NIT3112 Lab Assessment 3 · Justin Lee</p></section>